      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『谢谢你』，训练员。\r\n新宇宙，“学到了”。\r\n这『温泉旅行计划』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e593425bc990fa00fe188ad88bddae2e0019881d9b870c3f3adcaaace9138e94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
