      "uid": "zhcn:9ce30b9873403634f0e6e04a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在温泉旅行之中，\r\n感受到了与新宇宙之间不可替代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1ca7bb082c48802aaf8c6334c492128c416e0a41ce0c373e84e9db6140f45c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
