    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d6e880402f53f5c3c4cb2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我记得……\r\n今天是坐了一整天的电车才抵达这里的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c4d3b52d3d9a2897baf2e1a4116e0def10d2562a57fd532f987a719ba65e01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
