      "uid": "zhcn:23d51212d6ba710b2504cce9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙她……\r\n进了温泉之后，就彻底音讯全无了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91fd81c2370290be96509d694cb2797831d3dce684b4c5e0e23e84e3369b11c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
