      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——日新月异。\r\n新宇宙的实力逐渐进步，\r\n而我与她对彼此的理解也慢慢加深。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe99bc721ffe083d32c494bb3dd94d873c32b1fb620c66cc17f191c340996a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
